==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 80~120 seconds<sup>2,400f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 80~120 seconds<sup>2,400f~3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use long ranged cats and meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] to block the Dagshund. Bring along [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and critical hitters for Metal Hippoe.

